# Twenty in Pirate Years, the edges of Ryoma's start (Norg; his default 94 alternates with his script, so each script
# turn is the second of a pair): a level 39 Ninja: nothing; a level 40 Warrior (bob): nothing. True Will's arms answer
# nothing for both (I'll Take the Big Box not completed, no Old Trick Box, trueWillCS 0), so the default plays after the
# script.
# carl (a level 45 Ninja; Twenty accepted with the Trick Box and trueWillCS 1, GMs; a state no play reaches, as True
# Will needs the Big Box completed): Ryoma's chain asks Twenty first and stops when it answers: 134 (True Will's 138
# would play if the order were swapped, and after it if the early return were dropped); finished: completed. Then
# Twenty answers nothing and True Will's 138 (trueWillCS 1, any status) plays. Level 45: the Big Box (AF2_QUEST_LEVEL
# 50) stays silent once Twenty is completed.
# At AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 39 (then 40 again): the level 39 Ninja gets 133; finished: begun, twentyInPirateYearsCS 1 (user
# ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs: the Lua's literal 40 gave nothing there too).
char zone=Norg pos=-26.276,0.53,-8.323 job=NIN lvl=39
char bob zone=Norg pos=-26.276,0.53,-8.323 job=WAR lvl=40
char carl zone=Norg pos=-26.276,0.53,-8.323 job=NIN lvl=45
carl: quest Outlands.TwentyInPirateYears accepted
carl: keyitem TrickBox
carl: charvar trueWillCS 1
login
trigger Ryoma                           # default turn: 94
finish
trigger Ryoma                           # script, level 39: nothing (94 after it)
finish
setting AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 39
trigger Ryoma                           # default turn: 94
finish
trigger Ryoma                           # script, level 39 at AF1 39: 133
finish                                  # begun; twentyInPirateYearsCS 1
setting AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 40
logout
bob: login
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # default turn: 94
bob: finish
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # script, a Warrior: nothing (94 after it)
bob: finish
bob: logout
carl: login
carl: trigger Ryoma                     # default turn: 94
carl: finish
carl: trigger Ryoma                     # script: Twenty first (accepted, the Trick Box): 134, not 138
carl: finish                            # completed: Anju, Zushio, the box taken
carl: trigger Ryoma                     # default turn: 94
carl: finish
carl: trigger Ryoma                     # script: Twenty nothing; True Will, trueWillCS 1: 138
carl: finish
carl: logout
